A: The procedure is to log the delay in the duty log under Facility Operations, which triggers an alert for the county coordinator who can investigate and resolve within 24 hours. Front-desk staff should not promise specific times to patients but instead confirm that the team is working on their case. Clinical decisions remain with the AfyaPlus clinical team.
